# EmailJS Configuration for Direct Website Contact Form
# 1. Sign up at https://www.emailjs.com/
# 2. Add an Email Service (connect your Gmail account: dahamsividara@gmail.com) -> Copy Service ID
# 3. Create an Email Template with variables: {{from_name}}, {{from_email}}, {{subject}}, {{message}} -> Copy Template ID
# 4. In EmailJS Dashboard > Account > API Keys -> Copy Public Key
#
# Create a local .env file in this directory with your actual credentials:
VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=your_service_id_here
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=your_template_id_here
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=your_public_key_here
